{"seq":2,"slug":"profiling-tracing","title":"Profiling 与 Tracing","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/analysis/profiling-tracing","wordCount":1078,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"profiling-与-tracing\">Profiling 与 Tracing</h1><p>Profiling 告诉你时间花在哪，Tracing 告诉你请求经过了哪些路径。两者配合，可以精确定位代码层级的性能瓶颈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>火焰图</td>\n<td>栈采样可视化方法，宽度表示 CPU 时间占比，Y 轴表示调用栈深度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>async-profiler</td>\n<td>JVM 最准确的采样型 Profiler，使用 AsyncGetCallTrace API 避免 safepoint 偏差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pprof</td>\n<td>Go 内置的 profiling 框架，支持 CPU、内存、goroutine 分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>off-CPU 火焰图</td>\n<td>采样线程等待时间（非 CPU 执行时间），用于定位 I/O 和锁等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eBPF</td>\n<td>内核层的可编程追踪框架，无需修改代码即可采集任意进程数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenTelemetry</td>\n<td>分布式追踪的开源标准，支持多种语言和后端（Jaeger/Tempo/Zipkin）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键路径</td>\n<td>Trace 瀑布图中决定总延迟的最长执行路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部采样</td>\n<td>根据请求结果（是否慢/出错）决定是否保留该 Trace，确保慢请求被记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cpu-profiling-火焰图\">CPU Profiling：火焰图</h2><h3 id=\"火焰图概念\">火焰图概念</h3><p>火焰图（Flame Graph）是由 Brendan Gregg 发明的 CPU 栈采样可视化方法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>X 轴：采样时间（宽度 ∝ CPU 时间占比）</li>\n<li>Y 轴：调用栈深度（底部是栈底，顶部是栈顶）</li>\n<li>颜色：随机分配，无特定含义（除非是差分火焰图）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"                   ████ methodC()&#10;              ██████████ methodB()&#10;    ████████████████████ methodA()&#10;█████████████████████████ main()&#10;──────────────────────────&#10;   宽度表示该函数占用的 CPU 时间比例\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>                   ████ methodC()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              ██████████ methodB()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ████████████████████ methodA()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>█████████████████████████ main()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>──────────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   宽度表示该函数占用的 CPU 时间比例</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>读法</strong>：找最宽的「平顶山」——那就是热点函数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"async-profiler-jvm\">async-profiler（JVM）</h3><p>async-profiler 是目前最推荐的 JVM Profiler，使用 AsyncGetCallTrace API，不影响 JVM 的 safepoint，采样更准确：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 下载&#10;wget https://github.com/async-profiler/async-profiler/releases/latest/download/async-profiler-linux.tar.gz&#10;tar -xzf async-profiler-linux.tar.gz&#10;&#10;# 对运行中的 JVM 进行 30 秒 CPU 采样，输出火焰图&#10;./asprof -d 30 -f /tmp/flamegraph.html &lt;java-pid&gt;&#10;&#10;# 内存分配采样（找分配热点）&#10;./asprof -e alloc -d 30 -f /tmp/alloc-flamegraph.html &lt;java-pid&gt;&#10;&#10;# off-CPU 分析（线程在等什么）&#10;./asprof -e wall -d 30 -f /tmp/offcpu-flamegraph.html &lt;java-pid&gt;&#10;&#10;# 输出多种格式&#10;./asprof -d 30 -o collapsed &lt;pid&gt; &gt; collapsed.txt&#10;# 然后用 flamegraph.pl 生成 SVG&#10;./flamegraph.pl &lt; collapsed.txt &gt; flamegraph.svg\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 下载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wget</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/async-profiler/async-profiler/releases/latest/download/async-profiler-linux.tar.gz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -xzf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> async-profiler-linux.tar.gz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对运行中的 JVM 进行 30 秒 CPU 采样，输出火焰图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./asprof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/flamegraph.html</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">java-pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 内存分配采样（找分配热点）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./asprof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alloc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/alloc-flamegraph.html</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">java-pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># off-CPU 分析（线程在等什么）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./asprof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> wall</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp/offcpu-flamegraph.html</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">java-pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出多种格式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./asprof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> collapsed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> collapsed.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 然后用 flamegraph.pl 生成 SVG</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">./flamegraph.pl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> collapsed.txt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flamegraph.svg</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"三种火焰图类型\">三种火焰图类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>采样事件</th>\n<th>分析目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU 火焰图</td>\n<td>CPU 周期</td>\n<td>找 CPU 密集型热点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存分配火焰图</td>\n<td>对象分配</td>\n<td>找分配频繁、造成 GC 压力的代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>off-CPU 火焰图</td>\n<td>线程等待时间</td>\n<td>找 I/O 等待、锁等待</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"pprof-go\">pprof（Go）</h3><p>Go 内置了 pprof profiling 支持：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import (&#10;    &quot;net/http&quot;&#10;    _ &quot;net/http/pprof&quot;  // 注册 pprof 路由&#10;)&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10;    // 生产中建议用独立端口&#10;    go http.ListenAndServe(&quot;:6060&quot;, nil)&#10;    // ... 应用逻辑&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net/http</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    _ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net/http/pprof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 注册 pprof 路由</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 生产中建议用独立端口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    go</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> http.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ListenAndServe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\":6060\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ... 应用逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>采集与分析：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 采集 30 秒 CPU profile&#10;go tool pprof http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/profile?seconds=30&#10;&#10;# 在 pprof 交互模式中&#10;(pprof) top10         # 显示 CPU 占用最高的 10 个函数&#10;(pprof) web           # 在浏览器中显示调用图&#10;(pprof) list funcName # 显示函数的源码级 CPU 占比&#10;&#10;# 内存分配 profile&#10;go tool pprof http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/heap&#10;&#10;# goroutine profile（查看 goroutine 数量和栈）&#10;go tool pprof http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/goroutine&#10;&#10;# 生成火焰图（需要安装 go-torch 或使用 pprof -http）&#10;go tool pprof -http=:8080 http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/profile?seconds=30\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 采集 30 秒 CPU profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pprof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/profile?seconds=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 pprof 交互模式中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pprof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">top10</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # 显示 CPU 占用最高的 10 个函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pprof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">web</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 在浏览器中显示调用图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pprof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">list</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> funcName</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 显示函数的源码级 CPU 占比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 内存分配 profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pprof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/heap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># goroutine profile（查看 goroutine 数量和栈）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pprof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/goroutine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成火焰图（需要安装 go-torch 或使用 pprof -http）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pprof</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -http=:8080</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://localhost:6060/debug/pprof/profile?seconds=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ebpf-系统层-profiling\">eBPF 系统层 Profiling</h3><p>对于不能修改代码的场景，eBPF 可以在内核层采集任意进程的性能数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用 BCC/bpftrace 工具集&#10;# 系统级 CPU 热点（所有进程）&#10;profile -F 99 -a 30   # 99Hz 采样，30 秒，包含内核栈&#10;&#10;# 追踪函数调用耗时&#10;funclatency &#39;java:.*processRequest.*&#39; -u&#10;&#10;# 追踪 I/O 延迟&#10;biolatency -m  # 块 I/O 延迟直方图（毫秒）&#10;ext4slower 10  # 慢于 10ms 的 ext4 操作&#10;&#10;# 网络数据包追踪&#10;tcplife       # TCP 连接生命周期&#10;tcpretrans    # 重传包\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 BCC/bpftrace 工具集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 系统级 CPU 热点（所有进程）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">profile</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 99</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 99Hz 采样，30 秒，包含内核栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 追踪函数调用耗时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">funclatency</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'java:.*processRequest.*'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 追踪 I/O 延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">biolatency</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 块 I/O 延迟直方图（毫秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ext4slower</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 慢于 10ms 的 ext4 操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 网络数据包追踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tcplife</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # TCP 连接生命周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tcpretrans</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 重传包</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"分布式-tracing\">分布式 Tracing</h2><h3 id=\"为什么需要-tracing\">为什么需要 Tracing</h3><p>在微服务架构中，一个用户请求会经过多个服务。延迟可能来自任意一个节点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"用户请求 (总计 800ms)&#10;├── API Gateway (10ms)&#10;├── Auth Service (20ms)&#10;├── Product Service (700ms)  ← 瓶颈在这里！&#10;│   ├── 数据库查询 (600ms)  ← 更具体：慢 SQL&#10;│   └── 缓存检查 (5ms)&#10;└── Response (70ms)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>用户请求 (总计 800ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── API Gateway (10ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Auth Service (20ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Product Service (700ms)  ← 瓶颈在这里！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 数据库查询 (600ms)  ← 更具体：慢 SQL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── 缓存检查 (5ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Response (70ms)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>没有 Tracing，只能猜测哪个服务慢；有了 Tracing，可以直接看到瀑布图（Waterfall）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"opentelemetry-集成\">OpenTelemetry 集成</h3><p>OpenTelemetry 是目前标准的分布式追踪规范，支持多种语言和后端：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    App[应用] --&gt; |OpenTelemetry SDK| Collector[OTel Collector]&#10;    Collector --&gt; Jaeger[Jaeger]&#10;    Collector --&gt; Tempo[Grafana Tempo]&#10;    Collector --&gt; Zipkin[Zipkin]&#10;    Jaeger --&gt; UI[Trace UI&lt;br/&gt;瀑布图分析]\">graph LR\n    App[应用] --&gt; |OpenTelemetry SDK| Collector[OTel Collector]\n    Collector --&gt; Jaeger[Jaeger]\n    Collector --&gt; Tempo[Grafana Tempo]\n    Collector --&gt; Zipkin[Zipkin]\n    Jaeger --&gt; UI[Trace UI&lt;br/&gt;瀑布图分析]</pre><p><strong>Java 应用（自动 instrumentation）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 下载 OpenTelemetry Java Agent&#10;wget https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/releases/latest/download/opentelemetry-javaagent.jar&#10;&#10;# 启动 Java 应用时附加 Agent（零代码修改）&#10;java \\&#10;  -javaagent:./opentelemetry-javaagent.jar \\&#10;  -Dotel.service.name=product-service \\&#10;  -Dotel.exporter.otlp.endpoint=http://otel-collector:4317 \\&#10;  -Dotel.traces.sampler=parentbased_traceidratio \\&#10;  -Dotel.traces.sampler.arg=0.1 \\  # 采样 10% 的请求&#10;  -jar app.jar\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 下载 OpenTelemetry Java Agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wget</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/releases/latest/download/opentelemetry-javaagent.jar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 启动 Java 应用时附加 Agent（零代码修改）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">java</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -javaagent:./opentelemetry-javaagent.jar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -Dotel.service.name=product-service</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -Dotel.exporter.otlp.endpoint=http://otel-collector:4317</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -Dotel.traces.sampler=parentbased_traceidratio</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  -Dotel.traces.sampler.arg=0.1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 采样 10% 的请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  -jar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.jar</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Go 应用（手动 instrumentation）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import (&#10;    &quot;go.opentelemetry.io/otel&quot;&#10;    &quot;go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;var tracer = otel.Tracer(&quot;product-service&quot;)&#10;&#10;func GetProduct(ctx context.Context, id int) (*Product, error) {&#10;    ctx, span := tracer.Start(ctx, &quot;GetProduct&quot;,&#10;        trace.WithAttributes(attribute.Int(&quot;product.id&quot;, id)),&#10;    )&#10;    defer span.End()&#10;&#10;    // 数据库查询会自动创建子 span（如果使用了 otelsql）&#10;    product, err := db.QueryProductWithContext(ctx, id)&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        span.RecordError(err)&#10;        span.SetStatus(codes.Error, err.Error())&#10;        return nil, err&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return product, nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go.opentelemetry.io/otel</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> otel.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Tracer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"product-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GetProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ctx, span </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"GetProduct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithAttributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(attribute.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"product.id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, id)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">End</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 数据库查询会自动创建子 span（如果使用了 otelsql）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    product, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">QueryProductWithContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RecordError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(codes.Error, err.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"关键路径分析\">关键路径分析</h3><p>在 Trace 瀑布图中，关键路径（Critical Path）是决定总延迟的最长路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Trace 示例（总计 500ms）：&#10;──────────────────────────────────── API Gateway (500ms)&#10;  ├──────────── Auth (100ms)&#10;  └──────────────────────────────────── Product Service (400ms)  ← 关键路径&#10;      ├──── 缓存查询 (5ms)&#10;      └───────────────────────────────── DB Query (390ms)  ← 关键路径&#10;          ├── 等待连接池 (100ms)  ← 优先优化这里&#10;          └── SQL 执行 (290ms)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Trace 示例（总计 500ms）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>──────────────────────────────────── API Gateway (500ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ├──────────── Auth (100ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └──────────────────────────────────── Product Service (400ms)  ← 关键路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ├──── 缓存查询 (5ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      └───────────────────────────────── DB Query (390ms)  ← 关键路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          ├── 等待连接池 (100ms)  ← 优先优化这里</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          └── SQL 执行 (290ms)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键路径上的任何优化都直接减少总延迟，而非关键路径上的优化不会改善用户体验。</p>\n<h3 id=\"span-属性与标注\">Span 属性与标注</h3><p>为 Span 添加有意义的属性，让 Trace 数据更易分析：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Python with opentelemetry-sdk&#10;from opentelemetry import trace&#10;from opentelemetry.trace.status import Status, StatusCode&#10;&#10;tracer = trace.get_tracer(&quot;order-service&quot;)&#10;&#10;def process_order(order_id: str, user_id: str):&#10;    with tracer.start_as_current_span(&quot;process_order&quot;) as span:&#10;        span.set_attribute(&quot;order.id&quot;, order_id)&#10;        span.set_attribute(&quot;user.id&quot;, user_id)&#10;        span.set_attribute(&quot;order.type&quot;, &quot;standard&quot;)&#10;&#10;        try:&#10;            result = do_process(order_id)&#10;            span.set_attribute(&quot;order.items_count&quot;, len(result.items))&#10;            return result&#10;        except OutOfStockError as e:&#10;            span.set_status(Status(StatusCode.ERROR, str(e)))&#10;            span.set_attribute(&quot;error.type&quot;, &quot;out_of_stock&quot;)&#10;            raise\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Python with opentelemetry-sdk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opentelemetry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opentelemetry.trace.status </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Status, StatusCode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tracer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace.get_tracer(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, user_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.start_as_current_span(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"process_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order.id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user.id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, user_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order.type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"standard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> do_process(order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order.items_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.items))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        except</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OutOfStockError </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            span.set_status(Status(StatusCode.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(e)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"error.type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"out_of_stock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            raise</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"采样策略\">采样策略</h3><p>100% 采样会产生大量数据，生产环境需要合理的采样策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>头部采样（固定比例）</td>\n<td>高流量服务</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部采样（按结果采样）</td>\n<td>确保错误都被记录</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应采样</td>\n<td>流量波动大的服务</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100% 采样</td>\n<td>负载测试期间</td>\n<td>高（但值得）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>负载测试期间建议<strong>100% 采样</strong>，这样能准确定位高负载下的慢路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# OTel Collector 配置：负载测试时的尾部采样&#10;processors:&#10;  tail_sampling:&#10;    decision_wait: 10s&#10;    policies:&#10;      # 保留所有慢请求（&gt; 500ms）&#10;      - name: slow-requests&#10;        type: latency&#10;        latency: { threshold_ms: 500 }&#10;      # 保留所有错误&#10;      - name: all-errors&#10;        type: status_code&#10;        status_code: { status_codes: [ERROR] }&#10;      # 随机保留 10% 的其他请求&#10;      - name: random-sample&#10;        type: probabilistic&#10;        probabilistic: { sampling_percentage: 10 }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># OTel Collector 配置：负载测试时的尾部采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tail_sampling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    decision_wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 保留所有慢请求（> 500ms）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slow-requests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">latency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        latency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">threshold_ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 保留所有错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">all-errors</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">status_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        status_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">status_codes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 随机保留 10% 的其他请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">random-sample</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">probabilistic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        probabilistic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sampling_percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"profiling-与-tracing-的协同\">Profiling 与 Tracing 的协同</h2><p>单独使用 Profiling 和 Tracing 都有局限：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tracing</strong> 告诉你哪个 Span 慢，但不告诉你为什么慢（是 CPU 密集还是 I/O 等待）</li>\n<li><strong>Profiling</strong> 告诉你热点函数，但不告诉你是哪类请求触发的</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者结合（Continuous Profiling）是终极方案：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Trace[Trace 数据&lt;br/&gt;找到慢 Span] --&gt; Link[通过 Trace ID 关联]&#10;    Profile[Profile 数据&lt;br/&gt;找到热点函数] --&gt; Link&#10;    Link --&gt; RootCause[精确根因:&lt;br/&gt;某接口的某函数慢]\">graph LR\n    Trace[Trace 数据&lt;br/&gt;找到慢 Span] --&gt; Link[通过 Trace ID 关联]\n    Profile[Profile 数据&lt;br/&gt;找到热点函数] --&gt; Link\n    Link --&gt; RootCause[精确根因:&lt;br/&gt;某接口的某函数慢]</pre><p>Grafana Pyroscope 支持将 Profiling 数据与 Trace 数据关联，在 Trace 瀑布图中直接查看对应时间段的火焰图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战-定位一次性能问题\">实战：定位一次性能问题</h2><p><strong>场景</strong>：压测显示 <code>/api/orders</code> 的 p99 延迟在 1000 VU 时从 200ms 突增到 2000ms。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"步骤 1: 查看 Trace 瀑布图&#10;→ 发现 OrderService.createOrder() Span 耗时 1800ms&#10;→ 子 Span 中，DB 查询耗时 200ms（正常），但后面有一个 inventoryCheck() 耗时 1600ms&#10;&#10;步骤 2: 对 inventoryCheck() 进行 CPU Profiling&#10;./asprof -d 30 -f flamegraph.html &lt;pid&gt;&#10;→ 火焰图中发现 inventoryCheck() 中 90% 时间在 synchronized 锁等待&#10;→ 查看代码：使用了 HashMap 作为缓存，加了 synchronized 方法锁&#10;&#10;步骤 3: 修复&#10;将 HashMap 换成 ConcurrentHashMap，去掉 synchronized&#10;&#10;步骤 4: 验证&#10;重跑负载测试，p99 从 2000ms 降回 210ms\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 1: 查看 Trace 瀑布图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 发现 OrderService.createOrder() Span 耗时 1800ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 子 Span 中，DB 查询耗时 200ms（正常），但后面有一个 inventoryCheck() 耗时 1600ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 2: 对 inventoryCheck() 进行 CPU Profiling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>./asprof -d 30 -f flamegraph.html &#x3C;pid></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 火焰图中发现 inventoryCheck() 中 90% 时间在 synchronized 锁等待</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>→ 查看代码：使用了 HashMap 作为缓存，加了 synchronized 方法锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 3: 修复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>将 HashMap 换成 ConcurrentHashMap，去掉 synchronized</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 4: 验证</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>重跑负载测试，p99 从 2000ms 降回 210ms</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Profiling 和 Tracing 是性能诊断的两把手术刀。Tracing 从请求级别定位慢 Span（哪个服务、哪个操作慢），Profiling 从函数级别定位热点代码（为什么慢）。两者通过 Trace ID 关联可以直接回答「哪类请求触发了哪个热点函数」。负载测试期间建议启用 100% Trace 采样，平时在生产环境用尾部采样保留所有慢请求和错误，以较低成本持续积累诊断数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"兄弟文档导航\">兄弟文档导航</h2>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Profiling 与 Tracing","id":"profiling-与-tracing"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CPU Profiling：火焰图","id":"cpu-profiling-火焰图"},{"level":3,"text":"火焰图概念","id":"火焰图概念"},{"level":3,"text":"async-profiler（JVM）","id":"async-profiler-jvm"},{"level":3,"text":"三种火焰图类型","id":"三种火焰图类型"},{"level":3,"text":"pprof（Go）","id":"pprof-go"},{"level":3,"text":"eBPF 系统层 Profiling","id":"ebpf-系统层-profiling"},{"level":2,"text":"分布式 Tracing","id":"分布式-tracing"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么需要 Tracing","id":"为什么需要-tracing"},{"level":3,"text":"OpenTelemetry 集成","id":"opentelemetry-集成"},{"level":3,"text":"关键路径分析","id":"关键路径分析"},{"level":3,"text":"Span 属性与标注","id":"span-属性与标注"},{"level":3,"text":"采样策略","id":"采样策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Profiling 与 Tracing 的协同","id":"profiling-与-tracing-的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：定位一次性能问题","id":"实战-定位一次性能问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"兄弟文档导航","id":"兄弟文档导航"}],"prev":{"title":"瓶颈识别方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/analysis/bottleneck-identification"},"next":{"title":"结果分析与报告","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/analysis/results-reporting"}}